"tronche.com/gui/x/xlib/window/attributes/override-redirect.html>`__\\ 。"
"``transient_for`` 屬性的說明請參閱 ``transient_for`` `屬性 <https://tronche."
"com/gui/x/icccm/sec-4.html#WM_TRANSIENT_FOR>`__。"

#: ../../../developer/system/gui.rst:101 e865fd72c8b34c068dc452d64cb86a33
